{"pageid": 562, "title": "Victor Saint-Georges", "revid": 2746, "categories": ["Characters", "Characters (BOS comics)", "Characters (BOC comics)", "Characters (SIKTC comics)", "The Great House", "Humans", "Violet Masks", "Monster hunters", "Order of St. George"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Victor Saint-Georges</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/88/VictorSaintGeorges_BOC1.png/revision/latest?cb=20250131115805\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"VictorSaintGeorges BOC1\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/88/VictorSaintGeorges_BOC1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250131115805\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/88/VictorSaintGeorges_BOC1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250131115805 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/88/VictorSaintGeorges_BOC1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250131115805 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"VictorSaintGeorges BOC1\" width=\"270\" height=\"366\" data-image-key=\"VictorSaintGeorges_BOC1.png\" data-image-name=\"VictorSaintGeorges BOC1.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">The Great House of St. George</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Violet_Mask\" title=\"Violet Mask\">Violet</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Emissary</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a><br /><span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">The Great House of St. George</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\"><i>Something is Killing the Children</i> #0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\"><i>Book of Cutter</i></a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">Adults underestimate children, I've found. They are meant to be protectors, but often they fail to do this in the face of threats they do not understand. And then they can be harsh when they try to show they are still in control. But children can often tell when the adults are not in control. And they will choose to act in their own interest.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Victor Saint-Georges , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #0</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Victor Saint-Georges</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Violet_Mask\" title=\"Violet Mask\">Violet Mask</a> monster hunter within <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">the Great House of St. George</span>, under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">the order of the same name</a>. He is a mysterious man interested in <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>'s recruitment to the Great House.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>At some point, Victor was recruited into <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">the Order of St. George</a>, and inducted into <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Great House of St. George (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0dyZWF0X0hvdXNlX29mX1N0Ll9HZW9yZ2U/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">the Great House</span> to serve under <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Dragon King (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0RyYWdvbl9LaW5nP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">the Dragon King</span>. He became a <a href=\"/wiki/Violet_Mask\" title=\"Violet Mask\">Violet Mask</a>, specializing in spy work. \n</p><p>Victor had an interest in recruiting <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> to the Great House, and followed her work for some time. After her departure from the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>, he kept tabs on her, and eventually went to interview <a href=\"/wiki/Sara\" title=\"Sara\">Sara</a>, a young girl she had helped; at the same time, he disposed of her parents and drugged her ice cream so that she could later be recruited into the organization. Amazed that she was able to use Sara without making her feel unsafe, Victor decided that it was time to put Erica through the Trials.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC0&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC0-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Soon afterwards, he would meet with <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a> per her request at the <span class=\"new\" title=\"House of Cutter (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSG91c2Vfb2ZfQ3V0dGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">House of Cutter</span>. She would request the Great House's blessing to expand the House of Slaughter to San Francisco, Washington D.C., Seoul and Dubai. Victor would agree under the condition that should Erica Slaughter turn out to be alive following her fight with the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Duplicitype</span>, she would be under the custody of the Great House rather than Slaughter.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOC&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOC-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Victor appears to be of European descent, with pale skin and blond hair cut very short. He has blue eyes, though his left eye is swollen shut with a large and intimidating scar.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_0\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 0\">Issue #0</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books_of_Slaughter\"><i>Books of Slaughter</i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i> <small><i>(pictured)</i></small></li>\n<li><i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\">Book of Cutter</a></i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"7341cf22e9ea3068c7f812f0d2f3436f\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:163px; width:185px; top:11px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png\" title=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png (993 KB)\" style=\"height:163px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/66/VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241214165713\" title=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png (993 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"SIKTC #0.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png\" data-image-key=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\".\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png (993 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"SIKTC #0.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png\" data-image-key=\"VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\".\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/6/66/VictorSaintGeorgesSmirk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241214165713\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/w